e you can access it. \nNote that copyright laws explicitly *forbid* the use of a copyrighted work, *except* if you get permission. Such a permission is called a \"licence\". So: if you can not find a licence, you have to assume you can not use the data."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"What are the conditions of use for this database or dataset?"}},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:33:12Z","entityUuid":"3cb234c5-1795-40f2-b3e0-6e2d27d8fd48","parentUuid":"dd84fcb8-a5fb-449c-b6cb-071260a439b9","uuid":"b03dd108-f92a-44e8-8717-7f5152d7c24b"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:33:13Z","entityUuid":"4cfe11a3-485c-4bb9-a0f6-f262a5705984","parentUuid":"3cb234c5-1795-40f2-b3e0-6e2d27d8fd48","uuid":"c87a3a79-55c2-47be-b64c-1d5da91d9792"},{"content":{"advice":{"changed":false},"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditAnswerEvent","followUpUuids":{"changed":false},"label":{"changed":true,"value":"They are freely available for any use (public domain or CC0)"},"metricMeasures":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:33:14Z","entityUuid":"4cfe11a3-485c-4bb9-a0f6-f262a5705984","parentUuid":"3cb234c5-1795-40f2-b3e0-6e2d27d8fd48","uuid":"6b0b3eb1-e219-419b-9db7-3526221d46a4"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:33:15Z","entityUuid":"cc635ce2-417c-4b6f-813c-a71475356120","parentUuid":"3cb234c5-1795-40f2-b3e0-6e2d27d8fd48","uuid":"e10977a2-feb4-4022-8fb7-58100b257a97"},{"content":{"advice":{"changed":false},"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditAnswerEvent","followUpUuids":{"changed":false},"label":{"changed":true,"value":"They are freely available with obligation to quote the source (e.g. CC-BY)"},"metricMeasures":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:33:16Z","entityUuid":"cc635ce2-417c-4b6f-813c-a71475356120","parentUuid":"3cb234c5-1795-40f2-b3e0-6e2d27d8fd48","uuid":"