"State the exemption"}},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:36:01Z","entityUuid":"4a414aad-d7c2-4363-a6be-5058c118bded","parentUuid":"623aefbb-671e-4a66-8a7d-0001768692ce","uuid":"684d6f29-00c0-4ff7-8678-77795b89c5f2"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":true,"value":"StringQuestionValueType"}},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:36:02Z","entityUuid":"4a414aad-d7c2-4363-a6be-5058c118bded","parentUuid":"623aefbb-671e-4a66-8a7d-0001768692ce","uuid":"d7d1cd28-b42f-4c00-b158-8ec8faf784bd"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"itemTemplateQuestionUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ListQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:36:03Z","entityUuid":"4a414aad-d7c2-4363-a6be-5058c118bded","parentUuid":"623aefbb-671e-4a66-8a7d-0001768692ce","uuid":"f7c700fe-d50f-45a5-921a-eabb87c0c93e"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":null,"tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":""},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:36:04Z","entityUuid":"9f9a28e6-078a-4295-82bb-0ca4e106724f","parentUuid":"4a414aad-d7c2-4363-a6be-5058c118bded","uuid":"e693eed4-555c-408e-b618-0554d48378ed"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Exemption"}},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:36:05Z","entityUuid":"9f9a28e6-078a-4295-82bb-0ca4e106724f","parentUuid":"4a414aad-d7c2-4363-a6be-5058c118bded","uuid":"e9f28169-986f-4e56-b021-36a78631e11a"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":true,"value":"StringQuestionValueType"}},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:36:06Z","entityUuid":"9f9a28e6-078a-4295-82bb-0ca4e106724f","parentUuid":"4a414aad-d7c2-4363-a6be-5058c118bded","uuid":"675370ad-0e83-4bcb-8187-471fa739c0d5"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":null,"tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":""},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:36:07Z","entityUuid":"561b6ce8-d376-468b-b93b-1428f04d3670","parentUuid":"2c3dabdf-5182-4252-95d0-7f99d1054240","uuid":"394f602a-cae8-4c99-aaca-712b36b31d86"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Note: A data processing agreement has to contain the obligatory clauses specified in [Art 28.3 of the\nGDPR](https://gdpr-info.eu/art-28-gdpr/). The agreement should also regulate the use of any sub-processors.\n\n[Article 4](https://gdpr-info.eu/art-4-gdpr/) (8): *“**‘processor’** means a natural or legal person, public authority, agency or other body which processes personal data on behalf of the controller.”* Examples of this is if you use a secure computing environment provided by another organisation to do your analysis or to store the data, along with several other scenarios. In the case that you do, there needs to be a legal agreement established between the controller(s) and processor(s) as defined in [Article 28](https://gdpr-info.eu/art-28-gdpr/) (3): *“Processing by a processor shall be governed by a contract or other legal act under Union or Member State law, that is binding on the processor with regard to the controller and that sets out the subject-matter and duration of the processing, the nature and purpose of the processing, the type of personal data and categories of data subjects and the obligations and rights of the controller. […]”* Article 28 also lists the required contents of such an agreement. Your organisation and/or the processor organisation will probably have agreement templates that you can use."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Have data processing agreements been (or will they be) established between the data controller(s) and any data processors?"}},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:36:08Z","entityUuid":"561b6ce8-d376-468b-b93b-1428f04d3670","parentUuid":"2c3dabdf-5182-4252-95d0-7f99d1054240","uuid":"9d47b98d-b0b7-4510-95ce-dbf58f4b6f51"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:36:09Z","entityUuid":"3aa16b32-003e-46a5-92a7-53ca3428e579","parentUuid":"561b6ce8-d376-468b-b93b-1428f04d3670","uuid":"fbcc8593-deb4-4b72-b512-f407023d6d98"},{"content":{"advice":{"changed":false},"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditAnswerEvent","followUpUuids":{"changed":false},"label":{"changed":true,"value":"Not relevant"},"metricMeasures":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:36:10Z","entityUuid":"3aa16b32-003e-46a5-92a7-53ca3428e579","parentUuid":"561b6ce8-d376-468b-b93b-1428f04d3670","uuid":"ff336e08-bac4-47f3-899b-5d0c598898ed"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:36:11Z","entityUuid":"52da6324-516b-4b9c-b887-24997b50f330","parentUuid":"5