pelling reasons not to make data \"Open\", such as privacy, other sensitive data, or intellectual property protection.\n\nThe true goal of funding agencies is to create the maximum value for society from their investments. They therefore often add \"As open as possible, as closed as necessary\" to the requirements for funding."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Will you be working with the philosophy 'as open as possible' for your data?"}},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:43:13Z","entityUuid":"a40bb5c9-9b54-438e-aeb6-d330159557b8","parentUuid":"38958e9a-7b80-4d9d-b3bd-2d1ae8475260","uuid":"64ebe9d5-f714-46b0-9237-bb8f78b692c0"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:43:14Z","entityUuid":"4ea94a3a-68e3-476c-8da0-d6ecb7b19c27","parentUuid":"a40bb5c9-9b54-438e-aeb6-d330159557b8","uuid":"e1823f2b-c5ab-406a-9bf7-475d367f94b0"},{"content":{"advice":{"changed":false},"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditAnswerEvent","followUpUuids":{"changed":false},"label":{"changed":true,"value":"No"},"metricMeasures":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:43:15Z","entityUuid":"4ea94a3a-68e3-476c-8da0-d6ecb7b19c27","parentUuid":"a40bb5c9-9b54-438e-aeb6-d330159557b8","uuid":"0aed706c-75ca-4dc9-b195-502038e1bddb"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:43:16Z","entityUuid":"f3168cff-f21b-4a1a-a699-34851abed79a","parentUuid":"a40bb5c9-9b54-438e-aeb6-d330159557b8","uuid":"120ff29e-5a2e-4b32-9702-a278b5d128dd"},{"content":{"advice":{"changed":false},"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditAnswerEvent","followUpUuids":{"changed":false},"label":{"changed":true,"value":"Yes"},"metricMeasures":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2023-08-01T13:43:17Z","entityUuid":"f3168cff-f21b-4a1a-a699-34851abed79a","parentUuid":"a40bb5c9-9b54-438e-aeb6-d330159557b8","uuid":"c9635335-d801-46be-ac8f-09821c834acd"}