"changed":false},"variables":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-01-13T08:06:33Z","entityUuid":"4fedbb49-bd9a-4f91-96a4-89db7f706d15","parentUuid":"2563c25b-4c5c-4840-a3f4-09e5de5ded4f","uuid":"74d19d32-9457-4655-8c0d-da8ec086f6a4"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"If yes, we will direct you to the [License Selector](https://github.com/ufal/public-license-selector), a tool that helps you choose the most suitable open license for your case"},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-01-13T08:06:34Z","entityUuid":"447e7d3f-b8f3-4dc3-ac7c-3d5ee9471e04","parentUuid":"ef5801b4-70d2-4442-987d-cbd6b754f3ba","uuid":"b6e6852d-c9ca-4651-8cf1-766e1eb8f31d"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"integrationUuid":{"changed":false},"questionType":"IntegrationQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Widget Integration - License Selector"},"variables":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-01-13T08:06:35Z","entityUuid":"ac0669f1-bc74-422d-992f-fc3a24919894","parentUuid":"f20fde3e-a268-44d1-b83a-e99b940cd544","uuid":"284bc337-03d1-4a3b-bfd2-fbb47986615e"}],"forkOfPackageId":"dmp.eosc.cz:czech-nrp-km:0.1.0","id":"dmp.eosc.cz:czech-nrp-km:0.1.1","kmId":"czech-nrp-km","license":"Apache-2.0","mergeCheckpointPackageId":"dmp.eosc.cz:czech-nrp-km:0.1.0","metamodelVersion":20,"name":"Czech National Repository Platform KM","nonEditable":false,"organizationId":"dmp.eosc.cz","phase":"ReleasedKnowledgeModelPackagePhase","previousPackageId":"dmp.eosc.cz:czech-nrp-km:0.1.0","readme":"# Czech National Repository Platform KM\n\n*DSW Knowledge Model tailored to needs and specifics of Czech National Repository Platform for Research Data*\n\n## Maintainers\n\nResponsible for the overall management and development of the knowledge model, ensuring its continuous improvement, and overseeing contributions to maintain its integrity and relevance.\n\n* **Jana Martínková** \n  * [jana.martinkova@cvut.cz](mailto:jana.martinkova@cvut.cz)\n  * ORCID: [0000-0001-8575-6533](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8575-6533)\n  * *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n* **Kryštof Komanec** \n  * [krystof.komanec@fit.cvut.cz](mailto:krystof.komanec@fit.cvut.cz)\n  * ORCID: [0000-0003-3856-1682](https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3856-1682) \n  * *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n\n## Contributors\n\nContribute to the knowledge model by adding new information, refining existing content, or providing insights to improve its quality and applicability.\n\n* **Marek Suchánek**, ORCID: [0000-0001-7525-9218](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7525-9218), *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n* **Georgia Koutentaki**, ORCID: [0000-0002-8099-9963](https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8099-9963), *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n* **Michal Růžička**, ORCID: [0000-0001-5547-8720](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5547-8720), *Masaryk University*,  (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n* **Barbora Loskotová**, *Tomas Bata University in Zlín*, (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n* **Antonín Zita**, *Masaryk University*, (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n* **Marika Hrubá**, *Masaryk University*, (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n## Acknowledgements\n\n| ![](https://dmp.eosc.cz/static/eu-msmt.svg) | This work is supported by the project National Repository Platform for Research Data no. [CZ.02.01.01/00/23_014/0008787](https://www.eosc.cz/en/projects/national-repository-platform-for-research-data-os-i-nrp/national-repository-platform). |\n|-------------------------------------|---|\n\n## Changelog\n\n### 0.1.1\n\n*Released*: 2025-05-03\n\n* Add structure and preparation for License Selector\n* Add standard protocol and SW documentation\n* Add ORCID validation\n* Add \"Creator of DMP\" to roles\n* Improve integrations (link in response)\n\n### 0.1.0\n\n*Released*: 2025-08-01\n\n* Initial version for testing and further development","version":"0.1.1"},{"createdAt":"2025-03-25T08:29:42.983777Z","description":"DMP tailored to Czech National Repository Platform for Research Data ","events":[{"content":{"allowCustomReply":true,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddIntegrationEvent","integrationType":"ApiIntegration","name":"","requestAllowEmptySearch":true,"requestBody":"","requestHeaders":[],"requestMethod":"","requestUrl":"","responseItemTemplate":"","responseItemTemplateForSelection":null,"responseListField":null,"testQ":"","testResponse":null,"testVariables":{},"variables":[]},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:14Z","entityUuid":"edc45195-9ad1-44d4-922f-ca86a08bc4db","parentUuid":"2563c25b-4c5c-4840-a3f4-09e5de5ded4f","uuid":"b72a6e79-85ad-4d96-af3b-c4d2e348ff67"},{"content":{"allowCustomReply":{"changed":false},"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditIntegrationEvent","integrationType":"ApiIntegration","name":{"changed":true,"value":"ORCID"},"requestAllowEmptySearch":{"changed":false},"requestBody":{"changed":false},"requestHeaders":{"changed":true,"value":[{"key":"Accept","value":"application/json"}]},"requestMethod":{"changed":true,"value":"GET"},"requestUrl":{"changed":true,"value":"https://pub.orcid.org/v3.0/expanded-search/?q=${q}"},"responseItemTemplate":{"changed":true,"value":"**{{ item['given-names'] }}** **{{item['family-names']}}** \nORCID: **{{ item['orcid-id'] }}** \n\n{% if item['email'] %} {% for email in item['email'] %}\n{{ email }}  \n{% endfor %}\n{% endif %}\n\n{% for institution in item['institution-name'] %}\n*{{ institution }}*  \n{% endfor %} "},"responseItemTemplateForSelection":{"changed":false},"responseListField":{"changed":true,"value":"expanded-result"},"testQ":{"changed":false},"testResponse":{"changed":false},"testVariables":{"changed":false},"variables":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:15Z","entityUuid":"edc45195-9ad1-44d4-922f-ca86a08bc4db","parentUuid":"2563c25b-4c5c-4840-a3f4-09e5de5ded4f","uuid":"bf3c5d08-ae22-4c3c-b6f0-a6e2c048cee0"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"integrationUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"edc45195-9ad1-44d4-922f-ca86a08bc4db"},"questionType":"IntegrationQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false},"variables":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:16Z","entityUuid":"93527fac-690a-4fc6-941c-da8ffee332f3","parentUuid":"11ee0c25-3017-4bd2-949d-c97439dffcb2","uuid":"3aee3670-b2f6-4845-a3bf-c823944cd670"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"What type of host is it?"}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:17Z","entityUuid":"7a45f09e-2013-484a-9dbe-c37ea7c85bf5","parentUuid":"da346cb8-e5c4-48e7-96b4-2f8b0a9cea5c","uuid":"c1ec3db3-7722-4fc7-8ce9-43f70a71712c"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false},"validations":{"changed":true,"value":[]},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:18Z","entityUuid":"6e679f0d-1b7a-4e80-b372-ac7ef454c84f","parentUuid":"53dcdc1d-07d1-4392-b8e7-cbf2b5c0dc29","uuid":"da2e12de-efde-410f-862e-3fd60d75c7c5"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":null},"title":{"changed":false},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:19Z","entityUuid":"6c1a6a0b-2525-4c0f-9afb-d5db065db8ab","parentUuid":"2deae714-e26e-4819-a113-a23ab7072bf9","uuid":"0f7c4b91-7ecb-4843-a1d4-5cfc70f0b8d5"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"itemTemplateQuestionUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ListQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Clearly and thoroughly explain each main objective of the project. Present each objective as a distinct, separate point for clarity."},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:20Z","entityUuid":"2deae714-e26e-4819-a113-a23ab7072bf9","parentUuid":"53dcdc1d-07d1-4392-b8e7-cbf2b5c0dc29","uuid":"8a504cfa-2de2-4a58-b24b-42900c1b696d"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"itemTemplateQuestionUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ListQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Include all the funding sources associated with this project."},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:21Z","entityUuid":"fda5df56-bb70-4bae-9594-afa9b665ede7","parentUuid":"53dcdc1d-07d1-4392-b8e7-cbf2b5c0dc29","uuid":"d5bb9dab-38c3-41ff-8b45-4b6959acfaa2"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"choiceUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"MultiChoiceQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Roles in a project should be given as they are defined by [datacite](https://schema.datacite.org/meta/kernel-4.1/doc/DataCite-MetadataKernel_v4.1.pdf).\n\nYou should specify at least one \"Contact Person\". If your project has a work package for data management, identify the leader of that work package as \"Data Curator\". Additionally, at least one \"Creator of DMP\" must be identified to ensure they are listed as a creator in the final DMP."},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:22Z","entityUuid":"53d10160-281c-4afe-bd78-8d370ed1cc09","parentUuid":"11ee0c25-3017-4bd2-949d-c97439dffcb2","uuid":"0a6738fc-62ab-4967-af32-990e2a57e057"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Which aspect of the project does this policy or procedure apply to?"}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:23Z","entityUuid":"57ebdd1c-b03f-4109-93fd-50818117b5a1","parentUuid":"711300c0-39fb-4eb0-9baa-dd6d5aa77174","uuid":"fb313db4-0784-4513-b4a9-09f623d86656"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"What other aspect?"},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:24Z","entityUuid":"9a4767d2-26ce-47d5-ba18-cde9b32ba45f","parentUuid":"b40864fb-5dcd-42d2-b959-a5665b2bca1d","uuid":"aba505f4-325e-4407-9510-b853c4fdb322"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"For projects involving confidential or sensitive information, such as personal data or non-anonymous surveys, it's crucial to establish clear communication channels among contributors. This ensures that all relevant parties, including data managers, researchers, and privacy officers, are kept informed about data protection procedures. Effective communication is essential for notifying all individuals whose data will be collected and for maintaining compliance with data protection policies. In such projects, you may also need to implement Non-Disclosure Agreements (NDAs) or other confidentiality agreements to safeguard sensitive information.\n\nIn addition, for general project coordination, communication channels should be established to ensure that all contributors—regardless of their role—can efficiently share updates, ask questions, and collaborate effectively. Clear communication structures help maintain project flow and ensure everyone is aligned with the project's goals and tasks"},"title":{"changed":false},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:25Z","entityUuid":"bf4cb9e3-64ce-4b3a-97f8-cb80b8258081","parentUuid":"53dcdc1d-07d1-4392-b8e7-cbf2b5c0dc29","uuid":"7684d5df-3fbd-478f-8c8c-9a626e0116c1"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditChapterEvent","questionUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["03bc384e-914c-4c93-94e9-f8e38ae99eac","c886e484-bbce-401d-9906-ce081e35be29","79dc637a-5e00-45a1-8246-3c2bf4b615f6","069c6907-ed6d-4b73-8ea6-fc9e77cdf6e1","6e679f0d-1b7a-4e80-b372-ac7ef454c84f","e31d9e4d-6072-4653-b44e-3903d7c711ce","4f8a9683-b9f9-4af0-a8dd-c63b2c533e9b","2deae714-e26e-4819-a113-a23ab7072bf9","fda5df56-bb70-4bae-9594-afa9b665ede7","f2b5ebb5-e672-4505-9c6c-421bab9e3be5","11ee0c25-3017-4bd2-949d-c97439dffcb2","711300c0-39fb-4eb0-9baa-dd6d5aa77174","bf4cb9e3-64ce-4b3a-97f8-cb80b8258081","5d67d420-a367-412c-ab65-1ab629ec1b3d","85cd1720-48bc-4cd4-ba23-1a5713efd4df"]},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:26Z","entityUuid":"53dcdc1d-07d1-4392-b8e7-cbf2b5c0dc29","parentUuid":"2563c25b-4c5c-4840-a3f4-09e5de5ded4f","uuid":"feaf6f0e-5800-42ab-96d2-a9ead2f076ca"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"integrationUuid":{"changed":false},"questionType":"IntegrationQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Provide the name of the data or dataset. You will be presented with suggestions from [FAIRSharing](https://fairsharing.org/), but you also have the option to manually enter the name of a data or dataset that is not listed there."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Data or Dataset"},"variables":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:27Z","entityUuid":"68bee231-12c0-44b8-b6cc-45a9a74e51f7","parentUuid":"24b6d7a9-e036-4386-819b-697aec341c51","uuid":"b96baff3-41aa-4b12-96bb-7122f354434f"},{"content":{"advice":{"changed":false},"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditAnswerEvent","followUpUuids":{"changed":false},"label":{"changed":true,"value":"Its quality is insufficient"},"metricMeasures":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:28Z","entityUuid":"902d716c-54e3-4650-a864-a0d1e8274961","parentUuid":"9e43c9c4-8b23-41e2-8ae2-5e2855842895","uuid":"0df5d7b3-76ab-48fc-b1ac-d5d53ce81b11"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Why did you decide not to use this dataset (or data)?"}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:29Z","entityUuid":"9e43c9c4-8b23-41e2-8ae2-5e2855842895","parentUuid":"fc24da42-307d-4891-bd93-253f38623291","uuid":"52a89dd2-a803-40b4-81c4-36314b0cfdb1"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"itemTemplateQuestionUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ListQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Much of today's data is used in comparison with reference datasets. You may be comparing your own datasets with a \"standard dataset\" which is maintained as a collection by someone else. Or you could be determining differences to a standard (for example in bioinformatics, a genome is often compared with a reference genome to identify genomic variants). If you use reference datasets, there are several specific issues that you should consider. What are the reference datasets that you will use?"},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"What existing openly available standard dataset (or data) did you consider re-using?"}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:30Z","entityUuid":"24b6d7a9-e036-4386-819b-697aec341c51","parentUuid":"c5ba5074-0ae3-42b2-9c8e-4f59e374a8c9","uuid":"67835bba-cb12-4dfe-8095-5b83c7703fc2"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Specify a URL or a persistent identifier (e.g. DOI) for the dataset or data. If possible, refer exactly to the version that you are using."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Where is this dataset (or data) available"},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:31Z","entityUuid":"230dc54d-d3e9-4e36-a2c7-74a391b390f8","parentUuid":"24b6d7a9-e036-4386-819b-697aec341c51","uuid":"012f9a84-8af3-4f3d-b722-4295f85f7971"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Will you be using this dataset (or data)?"}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:32Z","entityUuid":"c4179fb4-1298-4431-9990-362e025f3626","parentUuid":"24b6d7a9-e036-4386-819b-697aec341c51","uuid":"09e2d884-fcf9-4c27-8fd6-ab43c23d7be4"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Please specify the reason why you will not be using this dataset (or data)"},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:33Z","entityUuid":"48e6183c-d896-4eb7-9766-59d32bdeb0bb","parentUuid":"00955873-fa2f-487f-a6ab-effb773d278c","uuid":"b21c61c6-f900-4835-b0d2-c276e78df654"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Name of the owner of this dataset (or data)"},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:34Z","entityUuid":"9b73a03c-fae8-494a-a522-752f9fc13a78","parentUuid":"dd84fcb8-a5fb-449c-b6cb-071260a439b9","uuid":"d5121b23-be93-43d6-b7f1-63f53995ccb6"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Although there is no world-wide rule for the application of copyright on datasets (copyright only applies to things that require a so-called \"creative step\"), it is wise to check for an explicit permission to use a dataset and not to assume that data can be used freely just because you can access it. \nNote that copyright laws explicitly *forbid* the use of a copyrighted work, *except* if you get permission. Such a permission is called a \"licence\". So: if you can not find a licence, you have to assume you can not use the dataset (or data)."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"What are the conditions of use for this dataset (or data)?"}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:35Z","entityUuid":"3cb234c5-1795-40f2-b3e0-6e2d27d8fd48","parentUuid":"dd84fcb8-a5fb-449c-b6cb-071260a439b9","uuid":"2811312e-1344-4460-b45a-b3cecde6a8f0"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"What will you use this dataset (or data) for?"},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:36Z","entityUuid":"258c7868-be69-4810-a5ce-d26c19b54053","parentUuid":"dd84fcb8-a5fb-449c-b6cb-071260a439b9","uuid":"f76105fc-5f7a-4e8f-a526-60dc11fd340f"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Are any special tools/software needed to access or work with the dataset (or data)?"}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:37Z","entityUuid":"d1e1d711-4b45-4faa-b2b5-d4edb5a827ab","parentUuid":"dd84fcb8-a5fb-449c-b6cb-071260a439b9","uuid":"a693d9ee-ab93-4569-bc75-b55b93bf20b5"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Fill in the URL where the tool/software is available, if applicable."},"title":{"changed":false},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:38Z","entityUuid":"9e2b4adc-cf71-4016-ae38-0e1ec247d660","parentUuid":"08be1a10-89e6-49c9-8a3d-3512a3c1defd","uuid":"8afb5107-322c-4770-a813-d830d2bb4396"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Many datasets and data evolve over time. If the data changes, this may affect your results. If a different versions of data exist, you need to establish your \"version policy\"."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Is the dataset (or data) versioned?"}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:39Z","entityUuid":"c1de061e-b76b-452d-8ea9-21936a32ad18","parentUuid":"dd84fcb8-a5fb-449c-b6cb-071260a439b9","uuid":"8c76ae72-d86d-4fab-98a6-cc2bec01b6be"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Have you thought that once you are using the data/dataset, the author can release new versions (for any reason, such as a yearly update, error corrections, or adding new measures like a larger population)? How will these changes affect your project or analysis? If the version changes while you are working on your research project, you need to decide whether you will follow these changes. You can decide to stay with the version that you started with; this can have the disadvantage that you will not benefit from the newly added information or consistency. If you use the newer version, it is likely that you will have to do some analyses again, so you will need to make sure that you have enough resources available to do so."},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:40Z","entityUuid":"10009746-517f-4d74-828f-8b738876d20a","parentUuid":"e5a5738b-6134-4e48-9011-1f5d297982b1","uuid":"cb350cdb-5c21-48f3-bf07-d8dbe795403e"},{"content":{"advice":{"changed":false},"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditAnswerEvent","followUpUuids":{"changed":false},"label":{"changed":true,"value":"We will stay with the old version"},"metricMeasures":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:41Z","entityUuid":"43998997-7245-406c-8c44-4e79bf48dbfb","parentUuid":"10009746-517f-4d74-828f-8b738876d20a","uuid":"f9f2f716-1c44-4013-a433-02f117164c8f"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Do you know in what format the dataset (or data) is available?"}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:53:42Z","entityUuid":"77c6e91d-2f4c-4a00-a827-c325b26f9830","parentUuid":"dd84fcb8-a5fb-449c-b6cb