:"Specify, what standards you will use"},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-03-21T13:55:17Z","entityUuid":"9d822148-261c-485d-b4d3-bf7b2714924a","parentUuid":"2f5f729a-acca-47a1-91c9-fabbaa55896a","uuid":"1c8aaba1-4988-4d0b-a41b-585775b76ee6"}],"forkOfPackageId":"dmp.eosc.cz:czech-nrp-km:0.1.1","id":"dmp.eosc.cz:czech-nrp-km:0.1.2","kmId":"czech-nrp-km","license":"Apache-2.0","mergeCheckpointPackageId":"dmp.eosc.cz:czech-nrp-km:0.1.1","metamodelVersion":20,"name":"Czech National Repository Platform KM","nonEditable":false,"organizationId":"dmp.eosc.cz","phase":"ReleasedKnowledgeModelPackagePhase","previousPackageId":"dmp.eosc.cz:czech-nrp-km:0.1.1","readme":"# Czech National Repository Platform KM\n\n*DSW Knowledge Model tailored to needs and specifics of Czech National Repository Platform for Research Data*\n\n## Maintainers\n\nResponsible for the overall management and development of the knowledge model, ensuring its continuous improvement, and overseeing contributions to maintain its integrity and relevance.\n\n* **Jana Martínková** \n  * [jana.martinkova@cvut.cz](mailto:jana.martinkova@cvut.cz)\n  * ORCID: [0000-0001-8575-6533](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8575-6533)\n  * *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n* **Kryštof Komanec** \n  * [krystof.komanec@fit.cvut.cz](mailto:krystof.komanec@fit.cvut.cz)\n  * ORCID: [0000-0003-3856-1682](https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3856-1682) \n  * *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n\n## Contributors\n\nContribute to the knowledge model by adding new information, refining existing content, or providing insights to improve its quality and applicability.\n\n* **Marek Suchánek**, ORCID: [0000-0001-7525-9218](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7525-9218), *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n* **Georgia Koutentaki**, ORCID: [0000-0002-8099-9963](https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8099-9963), *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n* **Michal Růžička**, ORCID: [0000-0001-5547-8720](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5547-8720), *Masaryk University*,  (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n* **Barbora Loskotová**, *Tomas Bata University in Zlín*, (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n* **Antonín Zita**, *Masaryk University*, (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n* **Marika Hrubá**, *Masaryk University*, (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n## Acknowledgements\n\n| ![](https://dmp.eosc.cz/static/eu-msmt.svg) | This work is supported by the project National Repository Platform for Research Data no. [CZ.02.01.01/00/23_014/0008787](https://www.eosc.cz/en/projects/national-repository-platform-for-research-data-os-i-nrp/national-repository-platform). |\n|-------------------------------------|---|\n\n## Changelog\n\n### 0.1.2\n\n*Released*: 2025-25-03\n\n* Refine the wording and order of the questions\n* Add a question for uploading the Data Sharing Agreement and Preservation Statement documents\n* Add URL question for measuring instrument, Data Sharing Agreement and Preservation Statement\n\n### 0.1.1\n\n*Released*: 2025-05-03\n\n* Add structure and preparation for License Selector\n* Add standard protocol and SW documentation\n* Add ORCID validation\n* Add \"Creator of DMP\" to roles\n* Improve integrations (link in response)\n\n### 0.1.0\n\n*Released*: 2025-08-01\n\n* Initial version for testing and further development","version":"0.1.2"},{"createdAt":"2025-04-08T14:38:31.063848Z","description":"DMP tailored to Czech National Repository Platform for Research Data ","events":[{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"integrationUuid":{"changed":false},"questionType":"IntegrationQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Click the *Select* button to launch the [License Selector](https://github.com/ufal/public-license-selector) tool."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Select the license using the License Selector tool"},"variables":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-04-08T14:07:25Z","entityUuid":"ac0669f1-bc74-422d-992f-fc3a24919894","parentUuid":"f20fde3e-a268-44d1-b83a-e99b940cd544","uuid":"c3a6d314-882c-4484-959b-e08eb9495da9"},{"content":{"advice":{"changed":true,"value":null},"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditAnswerEvent","followUpUuids":{"changed":false},"label":{"changed":false},"metricMeasures":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-04-08T14:21:55Z","entityUuid":"f20fde3e-a268-44d1-b83a-e99b940cd544","parentUuid":"447e7d3f-b8f3-4dc3-ac7c-3d5ee9471e04","uuid":"0c2cd8d3-88f2-42ed-acdc-0841934acabf"}],"forkOfPackageId":"dmp.eosc.cz:czech-nrp-km:0.1.1","id":"dmp.eosc.cz:czech-nrp-km:0.1.3","kmId":"czech-nrp-km","license":"Apache-2.0","mergeCheckpointPackageId":"dmp.eosc.cz:czech-nrp-km:0.1.1","metamodelVersion":20,"name":"Czech National Repository Platform KM","nonEditable":false,"organizationId":"dmp.eosc.cz","phase":"ReleasedKnowledgeModelPackagePhase","previousPackageId":"dmp.eosc.cz:czech-nrp-km:0.1.2","readme":"# Czech National Repository Platform KM\n\n*DSW Knowledge Model tailored to needs and specifics of Czech National Repository Platform for Research Data*\n\n## Maintainers\n\nResponsible for the overall management and development of the knowledge model, ensuring its continuous improvement, and overseeing contributions to maintain its integrity and relevance.\n\n* **Jana Martínková** \n  * [jana.martinkova@cvut.cz](mailto:jana.martinkova@cvut.cz)\n  * ORCID: [0000-0001-8575-6533](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8575-6533)\n  * *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n* **Kryštof Komanec** \n  * [krystof.komanec@fit.cvut.cz](mailto:krystof.komanec@fit.cvut.cz)\n  * ORCID: [0000-0003-3856-1682](https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3856-1682) \n  * *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n\n## Contributors\n\nContribute to the knowledge model by adding new information, refining existing content, or providing insights to improve its quality and applicability.\n\n* **Marek Suchánek**, ORCID: [0000-0001-7525-9218](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7525-9218), *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n* **Georgia Koutentaki**, ORCID: [0000-0002-8099-9963](https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8099-9963), *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n* **Michal Růžička**, ORCID: [0000-0001-5547-8720](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5547-8720), *Masaryk University*,  (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n* **Barbora Loskotová**, *Tomas Bata University in Zlín*, (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n* **Antonín Zita**, *Masaryk University*, (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n* **Marika Hrubá**, *Masaryk University*, (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n## Acknowledgements\n\n| ![](https://dmp.eosc.cz/static/eu-msmt.svg) | This work is supported by the project National Repository Platform for Research Data no. [CZ.02.01.01/00/23_014/0008787](https://www.eosc.cz/en/projects/national-repository-platform-for-research-data-os-i-nrp/national-repository-platform). |\n|-------------------------------------|---|\n\n## Changelog\n\n### 0.1.3\n\n*Released*: 2025-08-04\n\n* Integrate License Selector tool\n\n### 0.1.2\n\n*Released*: 2025-25-03\n\n* Refine the wording and order of the questions\n* Add a question for uploading the Data Sharing Agreement and Preservation Statement documents\n* Add URL question for measuring instrument, Data Sharing Agreement and Preservation Statement\n\n### 0.1.1\n\n*Released*: 2025-05-03\n\n* Add structure and preparation for License Selector\n* Add standard protocol and SW documentation\n* Add ORCID validation\n* Add \"Creator of DMP\" to roles\n* Improve integrations (link in response)\n\n### 0.1.0\n\n*Released*: 2025-08-01\n\n* Initial version for testing and further development","version":"0.1.3"},{"createdAt":"2025-05-21T13:33:02.318007Z","description":"DMP tailored to Czech National Repository Platform for Research Data ","events":[{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":true,"value":[{"key":"json.key","value":"name"}]},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-04-09T12:49:02Z","entityUuid":"03bc384e-914c-4c93-94e9-f8e38ae99eac","parentUuid":"53dcdc1d-07d1-4392-b8e7-cbf2b5c0dc29","uuid":"a72c5c54-4fe6-45d1-89e0-9605c850bffe"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":true,"value":[{"key":"json.key","value":"acronym"}]},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-04-09T12:49:03Z","entityUuid":"c886e484-bbce-401d-9906-ce081e35be29","parentUuid":"53dcdc1d-07d1-4392-b8e7-cbf2b5c0dc29","uuid":"b303bfa7-da58-4403-94dd-624452dac56f"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":true,"value":[{"key":"json.key","value":"number"}]},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-04-09T12:49:04Z","entityUuid":"79dc637a-5e00-45a1-8246-3c2bf4b615f6","parentUu