{"key":"json.key","value":"reuseRestrictions"}]},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"itemTemplateQuestionUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ListQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Please document each **distinct data (re)use restriction** as a **separate entry**.\n\nFor each entry, begin by specifying whether the described applies to **all datasets** or only to **specific datasets**. If it applies only to selected datasets, you will have the opportunity to identify exactly which datasets.\n\nIf your project(s) involves only **one data (re)use restriction**, complete a **single entry** that thoroughly describes that restriction.\n\nPlease pay **close attention** to ensure that **all datasets** associated with your project are fully accounted for and appropriately linked to their respective data (re)use restriction. This is essential for maintaining transparency and completeness."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Data (Re)Use Restriction"}},"createdAt":"2025-05-27T06:22:11Z","entityUuid":"59c95237-c27c-40a5-96c1-260fdece89b4","parentUuid":"8e2dd2aa-8488-4433-afef-d7decd11c1b5","uuid":"f49aef8b-e82a-4ab7-bfe2-2b2f22853577"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Label of this data (re)use restriction"},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-05-27T06:22:12Z","entityUuid":"d221b5ed-6748-4b1a-ae76-d4d67d0bcd3b","parentUuid":"59c95237-c27c-40a5-96c1-260fdece89b4","uuid":"12c7c715-7627-4e3b-abe2-cd5f4c25bf8b"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Is the data (re)use restriction applied uniformly across the entire project, e.g. to all produced datasets?"}},"createdAt":"2025-05-27T06:22:13Z","entityUuid":"5d9fa997-90a2-477d-b2ab-90a5e38c94ca","parentUuid":"59c95237-c27c-40a5-96c1-260fdece89b4","uuid":"72ae4e4b-ebd6-4b23-8401-5b79349c78c9"},{"content":{"advice":{"changed":true,"value":"To accurately describe the **data (re)use restriction for each dataset** (or group of datasets that share the data (re)use restriction specification), please create a **separate entry for each distinct specification**."},"annotations":{"changed":true,"value":[{"key":"json.value","value":"false"}]},"eventType":"EditAnswerEvent","followUpUuids":{"changed":false},"label":{"changed":false},"metricMeasures":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-05-27T06:22:14Z","entityUuid":"0837ed17-271f-44cd-80c4-b05bd534b59d","parentUuid":"5d9fa997-90a2-477d-b2ab-90a5e38c94ca","uuid":"76e96c89-be5b-4ee5-ae47-d3bda6eeb9ac"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"itemTemplateQuestionUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ListQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Your project involves **multiple data (re)use restriction**, each described in separate entries, please **list here all relevant datasets associated with this restriction**."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Please specify which datasets follow the restriction described here"}},"createdAt":"2025-05-27T06:22:15Z","entityUuid":"d9b50856-a853-47b0-81a7-a62c6f316acf","parentUuid":"0837ed17-271f-44cd-80c4-b05bd534b59d","uuid":"80490237-8aff-4947-9b7d-8dc5cb53e07f"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":true,"value":[{"key"