tle":{"changed":true,"value":"Please specify the name of the repository or biobank where your samples will be stored during the project:"},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-05-27T06:30:02Z","entityUuid":"f4e32cda-0fa3-4a79-8398-6ad243f37750","parentUuid":"5ae8c50f-3644-4839-8a27-73395bce1ee0","uuid":"6d1c0cf5-fdb1-46d2-910b-bb47305f1d6e"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditChapterEvent","questionUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"This chapter outlines the methods and processes for collecting and processing the different datasets throughout your project(s)."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Data Collection and Processing"}},"createdAt":"2025-05-27T06:30:03Z","entityUuid":"30dd2bb9-9c2d-4ccf-b24a-428aea429b7a","parentUuid":"2563c25b-4c5c-4840-a3f4-09e5de5ded4f","uuid":"98a5cd25-377a-4b8a-bcd0-89c141cae45b"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"itemTemplateQuestionUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ListQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Please document each **distinct data collection and processing** as a **separate entry**.\n\nFor each entry, begin by specifying whether the described data collection and processing applies to **all datasets** or only to **specific datasets**. If it applies only to selected datasets, you will have the opportunity to identify exactly which datasets were produced using this process.\n\nIf your project(s) involves only **one data collection process**, complete a **single entry** that thoroughly describes that process.\n\nPlease pay **close attention** to ensure that **all datasets** associated with your project are fully accounted for and appropriately linked to their respective data collection processes. This is essential for maintaining transparency and completeness."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Data Collection and Processing"}},"createdAt":"2025-05-27T06:30:04Z","entityUuid":"5b1728ac-913e-434d-a2bc-741c2be8c883","parentUuid":"30dd2bb9-9c2d-4ccf-b24a-428aea429b7a","uuid":"000ff6ae-c4ec-4894-ac73-888f92a87cdc"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Please provide a label of this data collection and processing approach. This label is used solely to distinguish this entry within the questionnaire."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Label of this data collection and processing"},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-05-27T06:30:05Z","entityUuid":"d2098bc8-d3d4-45bc-b5f2-b395e12c5103","parentUuid":"5b1728ac-913e-434d-a2bc-741c2be8c883","uuid":"4ace32e8-8b1e-42cd-a6b4-a3aba2f8b5f2"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Is this data collection and processing approach consistent across all datasets you've produced?"}},"createdAt":"2025-05-27T06:30:06Z","entityUuid":"0c88f0a5-92cf-4e82-b528-6bdcf3a0bc8c","parentUuid":"5b1728ac-913e-434d-a2bc-741c2be8c883","uuid":"a1a9c27a-1dbd-4075-812d-eba247a659bd"},{"content":{"advice":{"changed":true,"value":"To accurately describe the **data collection and processing approach for each dataset** (or group of datasets that share the same approach), please create a **separate entry for each distinct data collection and processing approach**."},"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditAnswerEvent","followUpUuids":{"ch