onEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"integrationUuid":{"changed":false},"questionType":"IntegrationQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false},"variables":{"changed":true,"value":{"recordType":"identifier_schema","record_type":"identifier_schema","registry":"standard","status":"ready"}}},"createdAt":"2025-05-27T06:36:54Z","entityUuid":"3ab3a652-09cd-4c20-abff-48bbe5fe844c","parentUuid":"6856ec6e-9cb3-4310-bb03-c24b9ed8901a","uuid":"3b4800b0-b914-4350-96cb-4c6144a0b1d0"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Is this processing environment and data handling approach consistent across all datasets you've produced?"}},"createdAt":"2025-05-27T06:36:55Z","entityUuid":"25302c45-30e4-4194-be2e-c4e9d48cfb88","parentUuid":"0c1a9598-f650-4bc7-8e77-3be540cf7774","uuid":"78cf6201-85ec-4a5b-81f9-7e179bd8e28a"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"integrationUuid":{"changed":false},"questionType":"IntegrationQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false},"variables":{"changed":true,"value":{"recordType":"","record_type":" ","registry":"database","status":"ready"}}},"createdAt":"2025-05-27T06:36:56Z","entityUuid":"68bee231-12c0-44b8-b6cc-45a9a74e51f7","parentUuid":"24b6d7a9-e036-4386-819b-697aec341c51","uuid":"275d3a8b-4a6d-46a6-9e14-9ab3da9f0562"}],"forkOfPackageId":null,"id":"dmp.eosc.cz:czech-nrp-km:0.1.5","kmId":"czech-nrp-km","license":"Apache-2.0","mergeCheckpointPackageId":null,"metamodelVersion":20,"name":"Data Management Planning KM","nonEditable":false,"organizationId":"dmp.eosc.cz","phase":"ReleasedKnowledgeModelPackagePhase","previousPackageId":"dmp.eosc.cz:czech-nrp-km:0.1.4","readme":"# Data Management Planning KM\n\n*DSW Knowledge Model for Data Management Planning, tailored to the needs and specifics of the Czech National Repository Platform for Research Data.*\n\n## Maintainers\n\nResponsible for the overall management and development of the knowledge model, ensuring its continuous improvement, and overseeing contributions to maintain its integrity and relevance.\n\n* **Jana Martínková** \n  * [jana.martinkova@cvut.cz](mailto:jana.martinkova@cvut.cz)\n  * ORCID: [0000-0001-8575-6533](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8575-6533)\n  * *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n* **Kryštof Komanec** \n  * [krystof.komanec@fit.cvut.cz](mailto:krystof.komanec@fit.cvut.cz)\n  * ORCID: [0000-0003-3856-1682](https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3856-1682) \n  * *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n\n## Contributors\n\nContribute to the knowledge model by adding new information, refining existing content, or providing insights to improve its quality and applicability.\n\n* **Marek Suchánek**, ORCID: [0000-0001-7525-9218](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7525-9218), *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n* **Georgia Koutentaki**, ORCID: [0000-0002-8099-9963](https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8099-9963), *Czech Technical University in Prague*\n* **Michal Růžička**, ORCID: [0000-0001-5547-8720](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5547-8720), *Masaryk University*,  (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n* **Barbora Loskotová**, *Tomas Bata University in Zlín*, (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n* **Antonín Zita**, ORCID: [0009-0002-1049-107X](\nhttps://orcid.org/0009-0002-1049-107X\n), *Masaryk University*, (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n* **Marika Hrubá**, *Masaryk University*, (as part of work on [FR CESNET 756/2024](https://www.muni.cz/en/research/projects/72488))\n* **Tereza Kolmačková**, *Library of the Czech Academy of Sciences*\n* **Jindřich Fejfar**, *Library of the Czech Academy of Sciences*\n* **Lucie Hošková**, ORCID: [0009-0001-9695-2342](https://orcid.org/0009-0001-9695-2342), *Charles University*\n* **Matěj Uchytil**, *Charles University*\n\n## Acknowledgements\n\n| ![](https://dmp.eosc.cz/static/eu-msmt.svg) | This work is supported by the project National Repository Platform for Research Data no. [CZ.02.01.01/00/23_014/0008787](https://www.eosc.cz/en/projects/national-repository-platform-for-research-data-os-i-nrp/national-repository-platform). |\n|-------------------------------------|---|\n\n## Changelog\n\n### 0.1.5\n\n*Released*: 2025-24-07\n\n* Add annotations for document templates\n* Add tag \"Horizon Europe template\" to questions\n* General updates based on feedback from KA7 NRP project\n\n### 0.1.4\n\n*Released*: 2025-21-05\n\n* Refine the \"Producing Data\" chapter\n* Add phases to questions\n* General updates based on feedback from KA7 NRP project\n\n### 0.1.3\n\n*Released*: 2025-08-04\n\n* Integrate License Selector tool\n\n### 0.1.2\n\n*Released*: 2025-25-03\n\n* Refine the wording and order of the questions\n* Add a question for uploading the Data Sharing Agreement and Preservation Statement documents\n* Add URL question for measuring instrument, Data Sharing Agreement and Preservation Statement\n\n### 0.1.1\n\n*Released*: 2025-05-03\n\n* Add structure and preparation for License Selector\n* Add standard protocol and SW documentation\n* Add ORCID validation\n* Add \"Creator of DMP\" to roles\n* Improve integrations (link in response)\n\n### 0.1.0\n\n*Released*: 2025-08-01\n\n* Initial version for testing and further development","version":"0.1.5"},{"createdAt":"2025-10-16T08:08:24.037135Z","description":"DMP tailored to Czech National Repository Platform for Research Data ","events":[{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["d518a0a1-fcfc-4b75-8f50-25ab254f858d"]},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-07-24T09:21:10Z","entityUuid":"a08ffdfd-f568-4847-9ac0-073a8dfa6793","parentUuid":"ddd721da-cad4-48fa-9794-3bd876b0ef47","uuid":"209cdd62-cbab-46e3-abb7-334fc1f71610"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["d518a0a1-fcfc-4b75-8f50-25ab254f858d"]},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-07-24T09:21:11Z","entityUuid":"3d8fad7f-1b5e-4724-bcb9-368009cda192","parentUuid":"77050c78-a7be-4212-aeea-4fe3cffac348","uuid":"67cef403-6d8e-4d95-ae29-b9f1bd72c289"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["d518a0a1-fcfc-4b75-8f50-25ab254f858d"]},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-07-24T09:21:12Z","entityUuid":"2330c439-0a50-4d14-ab8c-85ede20320b7","parentUuid":"77050c78-a7be-4212-aeea-4fe3cffac348","uuid":"b8167393-eb7a-4b84-adcc-ea2c04f3c2a1"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"color":"","description":null,"eventType":"AddTagEvent","name":""},"createdAt":"2025-07-24T09:21:13Z","entityUuid":"e7499b91-11ac-425c-b669-af8bd6cc6bec","parentUuid":"2563c25b-4c5c-4840-a