-2e3f-42b2-b9a7-201d6b98dda3"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"itemTemplateQuestionUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ListQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Please add each license that this dataset will be available as. For each license you will be able to specify when it starts being applicable, so that you can e.g. specify that the data is restricted for a few months and open afterwards."},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:44:56Z","entityUuid":"30769cc8-f18d-451d-90dd-a66db1001223","parentUuid":"73795601-7d1c-45f5-98ac-43c0152bfcd0","uuid":"7e850a58-57c2-44ee-add3-636ee2df8f70"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Binary file formats tend to change over time, and software may not stay compatible with older versions. Also, some formats (e.g. DOC, XLS) hamper long-term usability by making use of patents or being hampered by restrictive licensing. \n\nIdeally a format should be simple, completely described, not restricted by copyrights, and implemented in different software packages."},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:44:57Z","entityUuid":"58e8fa76-a414-4c81-b115-d3d7c232e597","parentUuid":"f1e49a7e-5671-4e4f-b4dc-703a197fcb4f","uuid":"635e4f98-4ac8-4bde-9475-3d1d6fb312d5"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","label":"","referenceType":"URLReference","url":""},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:44:58Z","entityUuid":"5ceb4ac5-1f43-4140-803d-9beb5bb64a1b","parentUuid":"233257b1-a661-4ecd-a176-2739ac9c59e5","uuid":"2f26d512-ea81-4973-81e5-0ef83d2f896f"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"description":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditReferenceEvent","referenceType":"CrossReference","targetUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"85cd1720-48bc-4cd4-ba23-1a5713efd4df"}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:44:59Z","entityUuid":"5ceb4ac5-1f43-4140-803d-9beb5bb64a1b","parentUuid":"233257b1-a661-4ecd-a176-2739ac9c59e5","uuid":"ee2c7e6d-0f20-4a5f-9629-e46bf2e4e171"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","label":"","referenceType":"URLReference","url":""},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:00Z","entityUuid":"f4ebb0c6-7e30-43c5-8042-9b82e81d2321","parentUuid":"46930e91-3b93-46cd-897f-4baa460ce0be","uuid":"19c56281-304b-438a-9f24-7e56eacc8143"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"description":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditReferenceEvent","referenceType":"CrossReference","targetUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"be881f59-db85-4713-a911-929ca539010a"}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:01Z","entityUuid":"f4ebb0c6-7e30-43c5-8042-9b82e81d2321","parentUuid":"46930e91-3b93-46cd-897f-4baa460ce0be","uuid":"ef77b5ff-39db-47c5-b058-c25b40edb521"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","label":"","referenceType":"URLReference","url":""},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:02Z","entityUuid":"82b11d04-234a-4226-aebc-ea776a95b444","parentUuid":"b8d98520-597d-428c-846e-8e8a432e1654","uuid":"5e3fa32e-6ebd-43fa-a83e-49962bb666b9"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"description":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditReferenceEvent","referenceType":"CrossReference","targetUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"a7a67bd9-7912-4321-880e-7cf0355ce301"}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:03Z","entityUuid":"82b11d04-234a-4226-aebc-ea776a95b444","parentUuid":"b8d98520-597d-428c-846e-8e8a432e1654","uuid":"4053353d-0819-44ed-8444-a2910b6b6aa6"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"itemTemplateQuestionUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ListQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Please document each **distinct metadata approach** as a **separate entry**.\n\nFor each entry, begin by specifying whether the described metadata practices apply to **all datasets** or only to **specific datasets**. If they apply only to selected datasets, clearly identify which datasets are associated with the respective metadata approach.\n\nIf your project involves only **one metadata approach**, complete a **single entry** that thoroughly describes the metadata approach.\n\nPlease pay **close attention** to ensure that **all datasets** associated with your project are fully documented and appropriately linked to their corresponding metadata practices. This is essential for ensuring transparency, interoperability, and long-term usability."},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:04Z","entityUuid":"7a12e6c6-09f8-4ee2-a6fc-99c4946c3de9","parentUuid":"c746ea6f-8a50-4455-a27c-4f6b77aacd99","uuid":"80dc5344-fcaa-4dca-84ff-1cc87be7206e"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"itemTemplateQuestionUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ListQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Please document each **distinct documentation approach** as a **separate entry**.\n\nFor each entry, begin by specifying whether the described documentation practices apply to **all datasets** or only to **specific datasets**. If they apply only to selected datasets, clearly identify which datasets are associated with the respective documentation approach.\n\nIf your project involves only **one documentation approach**, complete a **single entry** that thoroughly describes the documentation approach.\n\nPlease pay **close attention** to ensure that **all datasets** associated with your project are fully documented and appropriately linked to their corresponding documentation practices. This is essential for ensuring transparency, interoperability, and long-term usability."},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:05Z","entityUuid":"8ed92246-9844-4594-8f35-9ee03e87b839","parentUuid":"c746ea6f-8a50-4455-a27c-4f6b77aacd99","uuid":"3423a675-1dd7-4b4b-874e-96aa293eecb5"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","label":"","referenceType":"URLReference","url":""},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:06Z","entityUuid":"bde3f4ca-3086-41cb-80bb-a7702c23cee6","parentUuid":"ab9c58b1-b773-4515-9700-b361e7b25b6a","uuid":"e145466c-be77-403b-9bba-e8504940a879"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"description":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditReferenceEvent","referenceType":"CrossReference","targetUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"a7a67bd9-7912-4321-880e-7cf0355ce301"}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:07Z","entityUuid":"bde3f4ca-3086-41cb-80bb-a7702c23cee6","parentUuid":"ab9c58b1-b773-4515-9700-b361e7b25b6a","uuid":"c181b930-f25c-4c29-a2e0-71c7f7e11f2f"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","label":"","referenceType":"URLReference","url":""},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:08Z","entityUuid":"8bad7558-658b-4b1c-93b3-31526e5cb85f","parentUuid":"a0565b3b-44ac-4c63-9689-46ce3547bda3","uuid":"c273f4c3-eedc-4e7a-8db1-7b53dac3bada"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"description":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditReferenceEvent","referenceType":"CrossReference","targetUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"a7a67bd9-7912-4321-880e-7cf0355ce301"}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:09Z","entityUuid":"8bad7558-658b-4b1c-93b3-31526e5cb85f","parentUuid":"a0565b3b-44ac-4c63-9689-46ce3547bda3","uuid":"e6206b81-680f-4d26-a624-4e8ce172a309"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"This choice indicates whether the strategy is just **planned for now or already applies to certain datasets**. If it's still only planned, it will be recorded in the DMP as a future approach. **As the project moves forward, you’ll need to specify which datasets it relates to as they are created and managed.**"},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:10Z","entityUuid":"959f19c4-8a22-4c28-b94d-9bf83ef593de","parentUuid":"ddd721da-cad4-48fa-9794-3bd876b0ef47","uuid":"0fe85242-bd6d-4f0c-981a-747648f8968b"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"This choice indicates whether the approach is just **planned for now or already applies to certain datasets**. If it's still only planned, it will be recorded in the DMP as a future approach. **As the project moves forward, you’ll need to specify which datasets it relates to as they are created and managed.**"},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:11Z","entityUuid":"5477e120-82f5-4238-8663-1d5b263f6b8a","parentUuid":"5b1728ac-913e-434d-a2bc-741c2be8c883","uuid":"1ba509d8-20d7-4140-83c3-36a13f47c220"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"This choice indicates whether the strategy is just **planned for now or already applies to certain datasets**. If it's still only planned, it will be recorded in the DMP as a future approach. **As the project moves forward, you’ll need to specify which datasets it relates to as they are created and managed.**"},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:12Z","entityUuid":"7d6da307-8785-4ac3-8469-892db5d12b23","parentUuid":"d6a2ece7-c068-48b4-bfaa-b032f432afd8","uuid":"0354a4da-064d-45cb-ba8c-d56c0210d3c8"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"This choice indicates whether the approach is just **planned for now or already applies to certain datasets**. If it's still only planned, it will be recorded in the DMP as a future approach. **As the project moves forward, you’ll need to specify which datasets it relates to as they are created and managed.**"},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:13Z","entityUuid":"ab80111d-44eb-4a2b-a603-cbf45e811b95","parentUuid":"7a12e6c6-09f8-4ee2-a6fc-99c4946c3de9","uuid":"9dd2990d-2abb-4c02-8b9b-b141c52fe666"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"This choice indicates whether the approach is just **planned for now or already applies to certain datasets**. If it's still only planned, it will be recorded in the DMP as a future approach. **As the project moves forward, you’ll need to specify which datasets it relates to as they are created and managed.**"},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:14Z","entityUuid":"dc2c21bf-945f-4eab-ae96-b38b3b3add66","parentUuid":"8ed92246-9844-4594-8f35-9ee03e87b839","uuid":"16459945-081d-4d15-8355-1bb2f7a3a2d0"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","label":"","referenceType":"URLReference","url":""},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:15Z","entityUuid":"a23bf5fe-ff5b-4fd2-a3e4-610399254eea","parentUuid":"d60cc6f1-8fe7-4f71-8f85-6c4023972ebc","uuid":"17a8592a-3a01-4916-809c-a9aca541204b"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"description":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditReferenceEvent","referenceType":"CrossReference","targetUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"a7a67bd9-7912-4321-880e-7cf0355ce301"}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:16Z","entityUuid":"a23bf5fe-ff5b-4fd2-a3e4-610399254eea","parentUuid":"d60cc6f1-8fe7-4f71-8f85-6c4023972ebc","uuid":"845b5f08-69f6-4a42-9b21-cf31c95ec8c7"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","label":"","referenceType":"URLReference","url":""},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:17Z","entityUuid":"dcfba080-7115-4577-a9e4-d4998dfb3dd3","parentUuid":"2f90efdc-d97c-4cc1-a98b-c034805b64b0","uuid":"998e3501-0d16-4a57-a145-968eccdd7e90"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"description":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditReferenceEvent","referenceType":"CrossReference","targetUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"a7a67bd9-7912-4321-880e-7cf0355ce301"}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:18Z","entityUuid":"dcfba080-7115-4577-a9e4-d4998dfb3dd3","parentUuid":"2f90efdc-d97c-4cc1-a98b-c034805b64b0","uuid":"b03f7278-64a1-4787-82e2-b100a61ca9f7"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"The [FAIR principles](https://www.go-fair.org/fair-principles/) do not contain any direction towards \"Openness\". This is done on purpose, because there can be compelling reasons not to make data \"Open\", such as privacy, other sensitive data, or intellectual property protection.\n\nThe true goal of funding agencies is to create the maximum value for society from their investments. They therefore often add \"As open as possible, as closed as necessary\" to the requirements for funding."},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:19Z","entityUuid":"a40bb5c9-9b54-438e-aeb6-d330159557b8","parentUuid":"38958e9a-7b80-4d9d-b3bd-2d1ae8475260","uuid":"e06a2f49-1969-45d9-aafd-fbd6cffc8115"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","label":"","referenceType":"URLReference","url":""},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:20Z","entityUuid":"b466fcaa-3ee2-4f61-9725-afaaa5604914","parentUuid":"20dc6458-c42e-43ec-8aca-e60158c2e7c0","uuid":"87179c0b-5a30-4f9f-ab5f-6fe8f4f79b04"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"description":{"changed":true,"value":"More details about metadata"},"eventType":"EditReferenceEvent","referenceType":"CrossReference","targetUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"7a12e6c6-09f8-4ee2-a6fc-99c4946c3de9"}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:21Z","entityUuid":"b466fcaa-3ee2-4f61-9725-afaaa5604914","parentUuid":"20dc6458-c42e-43ec-8aca-e60158c2e7c0","uuid":"66553e57-24c6-4605-be7c-2c6d1256b95a"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","label":"","referenceType":"URLReference","url":""},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:22Z","entityUuid":"4feecf1c-7337-4736-a096-3f821b86e78c","parentUuid":"bb5b34b9-19c7-4dac-8fef-b9435b6d8438","uuid":"9c7959fb-52e9-4802-ae6a-c9cef816f513"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"description":{"changed":true,"value":"More details about documentation"},"eventType":"EditReferenceEvent","referenceType":"CrossReference","targetUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"8ed92246-9844-4594-8f35-9ee03e87b839"}},"createdAt":"2025-12-03T09:45:23Z","entityUuid":"4feecf1c-7337-4736-a096-3f821b86e78c","parentUuid":"bb5b34b9-19c7-4dac-8fef-b9435b6d8438","uuid":"6ad4d0ad-601a-4020-9ca6-a3f69eaf1cb4"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","label":"","referenceType":"URLRefer